  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">What Works to Prevent Violence: Impact at Scale</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will reduce violence against women and girls globally through innovative project delivery, taking successful interventions to scale, and using evidence to influence others to programme at scale.</narrative>
